["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"When Toddlers Resist Absolutely Everything the untethered twos\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-unruffled-两岁娃的疯狂抵抗不是亲子关系出问题-而是情绪在自愈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">30:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>两岁娃的疯狂抵抗不是亲子关系出问题，而是情绪在自愈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两岁孩子对上车、洗澡、牵手过马路样样说不，是因为经历巨变却毫无掌控感，这时该做的不是给更多选择，而是把边界收得更早更紧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">两岁儿童</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"“You’re Too Sensitive” Isn’t Helpful — Here’s What Is, with Dr. Sasha Hamdani RSD (Rejection Sensitive Dysphoria) amygdala prefrontal cortex DFK (deeply feeling kids) emotional vaccination\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-goodinside-怕被拒绝不是矫情-杏仁核过度警觉-前额叶跟不上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">49:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>怕被拒绝不是矫情：杏仁核过度警觉，前额叶跟不上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理医生 Sasha Hamdani 说：被拒绝的恐惧不是性格问题，而是杏仁核过度警觉、前额叶反应不足导致的真实神经反应，道理劝不醒它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">拒绝敏感性烦躁症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Legal Agents When You Can&#x27;t See the Data - Jacob Lauritzen, CTO of Legora Tabular Review Forward Deployed Engineer Legal Engineer Pareto frontier DPA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-latentspace-法律ai最大的工程难题不是模型-是永远看不到真实数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/927785d01eabb481-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>法律AI最大的工程难题不是模型，是永远看不到真实数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客户数据大多连律所自己都无权查看，Legora的evals团队只能靠分类和改写后的合成数据，去猜测律师们真实在做什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Robots Already Working in American Factories | Tutor Intelligence teleoperator / tutor greenfield market HRI(Human-Robot Interaction) action diffusion transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-a16z-机器人创业公司不卖ai-只卖-时薪16美元-这句话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>机器人创业公司不卖AI,只卖「时薪16美元」这句话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tutor向从未买过机器人的工厂主推销时，从不提模型和AI,只说一个数字——时薪16美元的机器人；这背后是美国一年仅部署3.8万台工业机器人、九成工厂空白的现实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Onion Futures Act corner long position short position open interest\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-stuffmissed-两个农民囤光洋葱操纵期货-让国会专门立法禁掉了洋葱期货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>两个农民囤光洋葱操纵期货，让国会专门立法禁掉了洋葱期货</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两人联手买下芝加哥几乎全部洋葱、逼经销商签秘密协议，又反手做空把价格砸到历史最低，国会因此专门立法永久禁止洋葱做期货交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">期货监管</span><span class=\"tag\">市场操纵</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"373 | Colin Camerer on the Neuroscience of Economic Thinking mentalizing cognitive hierarchy model / level-k framing effect burstiness (Poisson non-homogeneity) Neural Autopilot model neural gaslighting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-mindscape-科学家让大鼠的大脑-骗-自己盐水很好喝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>科学家让大鼠的大脑「骗」自己盐水很好喝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者用光遗传学上调大鼠脑内编码奖励信号的神经元，让它喝到讨厌的盐水时，大脑仍判定「这次很好」——感官与奖励信号可以被直接割裂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">神经经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $300 Billion Structured Notes Market Is Booming Vega Gamma Auto-callable Worst-of Knock-in / Knock-out Uridashi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-oddlots-3000亿美元结构票据市场-正在悄悄放大美股下跌的力道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>3000亿美元结构票据市场，正在悄悄放大美股下跌的力道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">标普、纳指、罗素挂钩的「表现最差者」自动赎回票据一旦不再按时敲出，交易商被迫同时抛售更多波动率敞口，而愿意接盘的做市商却在收缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">结构票据</span><span class=\"tag\">衍生品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Airbnb CEO Brian Chesky: “I Was a Great Founder and a Terrible CEO” founder mode skip level\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-howibuilt-airbnb能活下来-是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c49ad29f2140d349-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>Airbnb能活下来，是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说Airbnb商业模式好到能掩盖管理混乱，直到疫情把公司逼到生死关头，他才被迫从放权转向事必躬亲的创始人模式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: Who Wins the Inference Market | Has Open-Source LLM Inference Peaked? | What Happens to the Cost of Compute | The Real Limits of Post-Training and RL with Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO NeoCloud PLG (Product-Led Growth) sandbox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-twentyvc-ai推理不再有90-毛利-每多一层供应商就分走利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/039f47c822a2df13-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>AI推理不再有90%毛利，每多一层供应商就分走利润</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一美元从客户流到英伟达手里，要经过应用、模型、基础设施、云等好几层，每层都切走20%到30%的毛利，这就是AI基础设施公司回不到软件黄金时代毛利率的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Peter The Great Streltsi Grand Embassy knout fiscal-military state\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-historyhit-彼得大帝西游归来-只搬技术-绝口不提议会与自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e331afa96f76fb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>彼得大帝西游归来：只搬技术，绝口不提议会与自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他访问了光荣革命后的英国和共和制的荷兰，带回的只有造船术、刮胡刀新规和炮台图纸，议会与政治自由被原样留在了西欧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">彼得大帝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 13: What Is Neuroaffirming ADHD Support? A Counselor Explains neuroaffirming interest-based nervous system MCAS Ehlers-Danlos syndrome executive function\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-parentmojo-adhd不是自控力缺陷-而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD不是自控力缺陷，而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主流框架把ADHD当作执行功能缺陷、靠自控力纠正；这位心理咨询师认为根源是注意力调节和感官系统天生不同，这套神经系统曾是人类赖以生存的优势。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">神经多样性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"719. Revolution in the Soviet Empire: The Hungarian Uprising (Part 1) Salami tactics AVH Secret Speech Petofi Circle 16 Points\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-restishistory-点燃匈牙利1956年革命的-是一群诗人作家办的辩论俱乐部/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7094b2e761027f4c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>点燃匈牙利1956年革命的，是一群诗人作家办的辩论俱乐部</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十一年高压统治后，真正点燃起义的不是地下党或工人领袖，而是一群诗人作家办的公开辩论会，这说明拉科西政权早已只剩暴力，没有任何人心可守。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战史</span><span class=\"tag\">苏联</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"409. JFK: The Cuban Missile Crisis (Part 3) ExComm / XCOM Trollope ploy Operation Mongoose Black Saturday soft power\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-empirehist-古巴导弹危机差点开打核战-全靠一名苏联军官投了反对票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>古巴导弹危机差点开打核战，全靠一名苏联军官投了反对票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏联核潜艇B-59上，三名军官里两人同意发射核鱼雷，唯独阿尔希波夫一人反对——这一票按苏联规定具有否决权，挡住了核战的引爆点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">古巴导弹危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Nathanael Greene 2: Logistics of War | | U.S. Revolutionary War History Quartermaster General Fighting Quaker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-extracredits-独立战争最惨的两年-靠一位不想干后勤的人撑住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">E</div><span class=\"dur\">16:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>独立战争最惨的两年，靠一位不想干后勤的人撑住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格林打赢过特伦顿和普林斯顿，也在布兰迪万和日耳曼敦吃了败仗，但真正让大陆军撑过去的，是他硬着头皮接下的后勤总管职位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国独立战争</span><span class=\"tag\">后勤管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of GLM and China’s Zhipu AI GLM (General Language Model) MoE (Mixture-of-Experts) Model-as-a-Service KEG (Knowledge Engineering Group) P2P (Paper to Product)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-asianometry-智谱研发支出是营收两倍-靠免费开源模型换增长能撑多久/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/701791e3cef20e9a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">22:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>智谱研发支出是营收两倍，靠免费开源模型换增长能撑多久</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智谱把最新模型全部开源免费发布，但研发支出已是营收的两倍——这桩靠烧钱换声量的生意能撑多久，是全篇最后抛出的真问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智谱AI</span><span class=\"tag\">开源大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"183期重发 | 投资的周期思维、共识游戏与亏钱教训 Bullwhip Effect Crossing the Chasm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-touzishizhan-全球只有2-4-的公司能让你长期赚钱-其余都该阶段性持有/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>全球只有2.4%的公司能让你长期赚钱，其余都该阶段性持有</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">统计显示2.4%之外的公司大多让收益原地打转甚至归零，这期给出了判断一家公司是否属于那2.4%的具体方法：预期回报公式、估值锚点和企业生命周期买点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span><span class=\"tag\">资本周期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a 19-year-old intern built the growth engine behind this $2B AI company | Hector Serrano UGC CPM GMV ICP smart retainer ad fatigue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-lennys-创作者靠广告分成赚钱-而非播放量-撑起20亿美元ai公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c676784fa788b53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>创作者靠广告分成赚钱，而非播放量，撑起20亿美元AI公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创作者按广告花费抽成、不设上限，靠「smart retainer」兜底，这套付费UGC体系撑起了Whisperflow过去一年30倍的营收增长。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">付费UGC</span><span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Bending Spoons Built a $20 Billion Compounder | Luca Ferrari SaaSpocalypse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-a16z-ai把代码成本打到近零-但多数软件护城河并未坍塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>AI把代码成本打到近零，但多数软件护城河并未坍塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多数规模化软件产品的复制成本在AI出现前就已经很低，它们真正的护城河是习惯、网络效应和专有数据，而非代码本身的稀缺性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">护城河</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1371: How to Bat Away Marburg Virus clade / genotype TMRCA reassortment α-2,6 sialic acid receptor interferon epsilon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-twiv-水貂感染h5n1-传播路径空白三个月-美国农业部选择不查/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>水貂感染H5N1,传播路径空白三个月，美国农业部选择不查</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">得州奶牛场与犹他水貂场的H5N1已经对上信号，但中间三个月的传播链没人查——美国农业部没要求扑杀，也不监测工人和周边农场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">H5N1禽流感</span><span class=\"tag\">水貂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Mycenaeans: Was Agamemnon Real? Linear B Wanax Tholos tomb Cyclopean walls Corbelling Sea Peoples\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-ancients-荷马史诗英雄的名字-其实是迈锡尼泥板上的普通人名/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f59ba28fc2607a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>荷马史诗英雄的名字，其实是迈锡尼泥板上的普通人名</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迈锡尼王宫的记账泥板上，埃特奥克勒斯、阿喀琉斯只是欠王宫东西的普通百姓名字——荷马史诗里的英雄名，原来是当时随处可见的称呼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">迈锡尼</span><span class=\"tag\">青铜时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Carbon in the Arena, Mistral&#x27;s Le Chonk, the Agent-Run Economy, Ferroelectric RAM + New Hacks EUV Mixture of Experts (MoE) ferroelectric memory APT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-cogrev-生产数据显示openai比anthropic更少撒谎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bce300797e23ca51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>生产数据显示OpenAI比Anthropic更少撒谎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Arena用真实生产对话打分：OpenAI在未授权操作、虚假归因、欺骗性完成三项信号上全面反超Anthropic，个位数误导率换算到真实用量已经相当可观。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Using Agents for Long-Horizon Financial Work — Aman Singh, Arca harness managed agents fiduciary RMD prompt injection\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-ai原生财富管理公司-不是人在催ai-是ai在催人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f748ae3e2793f6d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>AI原生财富管理公司：不是人在催AI，是AI在催人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这家财富管理公司不是套了AI工具的服务商，而是AI原生的公司本身：智能体主动联系顾问与客户、持续追踪他们的税务和退休计划，人类只负责审批和执行交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1112 - Oct 31 2026 Scopus regression discontinuity design Penning trap CPT symmetry APOE4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-skeptics-超3500家亮红灯的问题期刊-照样被主流数据库收录/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>超3500家亮红灯的问题期刊，照样被主流数据库收录</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究发现3753家期刊出现造假预警信号，其中3557家仍被Scopus正常收录，说明「发表论文」本身已不再等于可信。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科研诚信</span><span class=\"tag\">期刊造假</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Helen Duncan ectoplasm teleplasm materialization medium Vagrancy Act Witchcraft Act 1735 Fraudulent Mediums Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-stuffmissed-她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没-英国用巫术法让她闭嘴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没，英国用巫术法让她闭嘴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">检察官当庭声明这与巫术无关，纯属诈骗，但真正促使动用1735年巫术法的，是她曾说中两艘英国军舰的沉没，军方担心她在诺曼底登陆前走漏消息。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灵媒诈骗</span><span class=\"tag\">二战谍报</span>\n</div></div></a>"]